1926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TmGZbqstJ9-UAY_EVRI_LOCATION_06_100088a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TmGZbqstJ9-UAY_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10008.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TmGZbqstJ9-UAY_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10008.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TmGZbqstJ9-UAY_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10008.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A female courier hands a parcel to a recipient. The recipient, an older woman, is smiling." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>7. Earth Day (22nd April 2026)</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Earth Day is the perfect time for businesses focused on sustainability to promote their products. If your business offers eco-friendly goods, zero-waste solutions, or sustainable packaging, use Earth Day to show off your commitment to the planet.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Consider running promotions on your green products and use social media to share how your business is helping to protect the environment.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Top tip:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Highlight your green credentials and offer a discount on sustainable products to celebrate Earth Day.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="landing_feature_banner" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrfpbqstJ9-WeA_EVRI_LOCATION_04_512731d4.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrfpbqstJ9-WeA_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5127.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6454%2C4305&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrfpbqstJ9-WeA_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5127.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6454%2C4305&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrfpbqstJ9-WeA_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5127.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6454%2C4305&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, sticking down the seal of their recyclable packaging." width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><!----><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we’re committed to helping businesses send sustainably, which is why we’re bringing you eco-friendly packaging options that are both effective and kind to the planet.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our parcel boxes, made from 70% recycled material, are 100% recyclable and biodegradable. Whether you&#39;re shipping books or sending shoes, these sturdy, FSC-certified boxes offer protection without harming the environment. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Some eco-friendly products you’ll love:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Hexcel: A brilliant alternative to bubble wrap, made from 100% recycled FSC® paper. No need for tape, and no plastic waste.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->HexaFil: For non-fragile items, use this 100% recycled paper to fill voids in your boxes and reduce movement.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->By buying our packaging products, you’re making a conscious choice to cut down on waste without compromising on quality. It&#39;s the perfect way to make your business greener this Earth Day and beyond.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Make every parcel count towards a sustainable future!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--standard" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-services/purchase-sustainable-packaging" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Discover eco-friendly packaging<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="section_component" class="section" index="13" data-v-997ea6a1><div data-v-997ea6a1><h2 class="section__title" data-v-997ea6a1></h2><div class="section__text" data-v-997ea6a1><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></section><section id="8.-small-business-saturday" class="section-wrapper" index="14" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><div class="section__description" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--v-if--></div><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_24688a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--h-100 card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>8. Small Business Saturday</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Small Business Saturday, held on the last Saturday of November in North America and the first Saturday of December in the UK, is a grassroots campaign that encourages people to support small and local businesses. This is an ideal day for promoting your online shop, especially if you&#39;re an independent seller on platforms like Etsy, eBay, or Vinted. You can get involved by advertising on &#39;small business finder&#39; social media groups and pages. There is also a ‘small business finder’ tool on Small Business Saturday UK where you can register your business and make your business visible nationally. In addition, you can create sales events and social media shout-outs to promote your small business in the lead up to the big day. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Small Business Saturday also marks the start of the holiday shopping season, so consider running a special promotion to kickstart your Christmas sales.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Top tip:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Use the hashtag #SmallBizSatUK on social media to boost your visibility and encourage customers to shop local.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" 